@startuml
title A crashed unit, discarded and retried once

participant Supervisor
database Ledger
participant "Run clone" as Clone
participant "Claude Code host" as Host

== First attempt ==
Supervisor -> Ledger : item ready to delegated, snapshot step, launch step started
Supervisor -> Host : launch the unit
Host --> Supervisor : ends with no result, a signal or a non-zero exit,\nor the wall clock fires
Supervisor -> Ledger : settle the budget (a killed unit is charged at least its cost cap)
Supervisor -> Clone : measure HEAD and the changes since the snapshot
Supervisor -> Ledger : classify step (inconclusive, or failed)

== Routing ==
alt the clone HEAD moved
  Supervisor -> Ledger : containment finding, decision record,\nrun blocked_on_decision (enforcement failure), clone untouched
else the host refused to launch
  Supervisor -> Ledger : decision record, run blocked_on_decision (enforcement failure)
else a loop limit, a spent budget, a pause, a denial, no progress,\nor an error result with exit 0
  Supervisor -> Ledger : decision record (reason and class by ending), run blocked_on_decision,\nnever retried
else crash or timeout, and the one retry is still available
  alt the invocations budget cannot cover another unit
    Supervisor -> Ledger : decision record, run blocked_on_decision (budget exhausted)
  else the budget allows it
    Supervisor -> Ledger : checkpoint discard-attempt (carries the lease fence)
    Supervisor -> Clone : restore changed paths to the snapshot, remove added files\n(ignored paths and earlier files are left alone)
    alt HEAD moved since the snapshot
      Supervisor -> Ledger : decision record, run blocked_on_decision\n(enforcement failure), nothing changed
    else restored
      Supervisor -> Ledger : discard step (side effect none), attempt discarded,\nitem delegated to ready
    end
  end
end

== Second attempt ==
Supervisor -> Ledger : context pack rebuilt, retry attempt opened,\nitem ready to delegated, snapshot step, launch step started
Supervisor -> Host : launch the unit again
Host --> Supervisor : result
Supervisor -> Ledger : classify step
alt progressed
  note over Supervisor, Ledger : continues as in the run to ready flow:\nG2, commit, final proof, hand-off
else crash or timeout again
  Supervisor -> Ledger : decision record (repeated failure) naming both attempts\nand how each ended, run blocked_on_decision
else any other ending
  note over Supervisor, Ledger : routed as in the first attempt
end
@enduml
